    "description": "<p>You banish a creature that you can see within range into a labyrinthine demiplane. The target remains there for the duration or until it escapes the maze.</p><p>The target can take a Study action to try to escape. When it does so, it makes a DC 20 Intelligence (Investigation) check. If it succeeds, it escapes, and the spell ends.</p><p>When the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or, if that space is occupied, in the nearest unoccupied space.</p>",
